      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 data-w-id="d07366c7-813c-4fe9-0a17-c44f3bdb8fc0" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left">Questions we get asked about our <span class="gradient-text">loyalty program</span>:</h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-d07366c7-813c-4fe9-0a17-c44f3bdb8fc6-6643cc89" data-w-id="d07366c7-813c-4fe9-0a17-c44f3bdb8fc6" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">What is Innovorder's restaurant loyalty program?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The Innovorder loyalty program works via a system of points that customers accumulate each time they shop, depending on what they consume (cashback system). They can then spend these points in the same store in the form of a discount, or keep them.<br><br>Innovorder's loyalty offer is available for purchases made at the checkout and when ordering online.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-d07366c7-813c-4fe9-0a17-c44f3bdb8fd0-6643cc89" data-w-id="d07366c7-813c-4fe9-0a17-c44f3bdb8fd0" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">What's the point of a loyalty program for a restaurant?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">For restaurants and fast-food outlets, the benefits of a loyalty program are twofold. On the one hand, it rewards regular customers for their loyalty, and on the other, it encourages new customers to become loyal in their turn.<br><br>The other significant advantage of a digital loyalty program is the collection of information about its customers. This information enables us to better understand and target our customers, and thus refine our loyalty strategy to achieve the best possible results.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-d07366c7-813c-4fe9-0a17-c44f3bdb8fee-6643cc89" data-w-id="d07366c7-813c-4fe9-0a17-c44f3bdb8fee" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
